Build should be done on final platform with Unipi Base OS installed.
Mkinitramfs tool is used to creat initramdisc during build process.

ttyd requires
---------------------
BIN: apt-get install libwebsockets8 libjson-c3
DEV: apt-get install cmake g++ pkg-config libwebsockets-dev libjson-c-dev libssl-dev xxd 

swupdate requires
---------------------
BIN: apt-get install libjson-c3 libarchive13 libconfig9 libnl-3-200 libnl-genl-3-200 libnl-route-3-200
DEV: apt-get install libcurl4-gnutls-dev libconfig-dev libarchive-dev

webapp
